The artwork in this directory is licensed differently from the application's source code.

`LICENSE` at the repository root is MIT and covers the code. It does not cover these files.

## What is here

| File | Basis |
| --- | --- |
| `miku-wide.svg`, `miku-tall.svg` | traced from pictures the owner supplied, which depict 初音ミク |
| everything else | drawn or generated by this repository's own tools, and this project's own work |

The two traced pieces depict a character owned by Crypton Future Media, INC., and are used under the Piapro
Character Licence (PCL): https://piapro.jp/license/pcl

The PCL permits creating and publishing 二次創作物 on three conditions that this project keeps -- no
compensation under any name (第3条第2項第1号), no sublicensing (第3条第4項), and the credit below. It is honoured
here and in the application's 关于空庭 screen, in this wording:

    この作品はピアプロ・キャラクター・ライセンスに基づいて
    クリプトン・フューチャー・メディア株式会社のキャラクター「初音ミク」を描いたものです。

    This work depicts 初音ミク, a character of Crypton Future Media, INC., under the Piapro Character Licence.
    https://piapro.jp/license/pcl/summary

Copyright in 初音ミク and in the Piapro characters belongs to Crypton Future Media, INC. Nothing in this
directory transfers or sublicenses any of it. `docs/licensing.md` is the full account, with the clauses quoted.
